<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">Thuhilsya</book>
  <para style="h">Thuhilsya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thuhilsya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thuhilsya</para>
  <para style="mt">Thuhilsya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hite sia David ii tapa Jerusalem kumpipa ahi Thuthuk ngaisunpa ii kammalte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuthuk ngaisunpa in a luithawthong, a luithawthong hi, ci hi. Nuntakna sia luithawthong, a vekpi luithawthong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na nuntak sungah naseam in na diang uh a, ahihang bang teng na lak tu om na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khang khat piangin, khang khat bo hi, ahizong simlei sia a om ngei in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni suak kik lai in, tum kik lai a, a sua natu munah heak kikin suak kik leleau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vui zongh thang sangah vasuk, saksang ah vato, a kot a kotin va a, kipan kik nithi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngun theampo tuipi sungah luangsuk a, ahihang tuipi dimleet tuan ngawl hi. Ngunte kipatna ah tuite heak kik a, tuaciang kipan kik leleau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na theampo in hong thinngimsak a, thinngimna sia kam taw son zawk hi ngawl hi. Ih mittang in a mu cim thei ngawl a, bil in a zaak cim ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A piang ngeisa tengma piang kikik tu hi. A kiseam ngeisa tengma kiseam kikik tu hi. Simleitung bup ah a thak bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in, “En vun, hi sungah bang ziam maw a thak khat om hi!” ci uh hi. Hi ngawl hi, a piang ngeisa hi lel hi, ei sua ma pek a, a piang sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hun bosa sung a thupiangte kuama in ciamtee ngawl a, tu le maisang kilaklaw hun sungah a piang thute kuama in ciamtee tuan ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei, Thuthuk ngaisunpa sia Jerusalem ah Israel te kumpipa ka hi ngei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a kiseam na theampo kantel in sin tong ci in tupna ka nei hi. Pathian in eite tungah a ngimhuai haksatna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a kiseam theampo ka mu zo a, a luithawthong vive hi ci in kong son hi. Tuasia in vuiva delkot taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A koaite na maam thei bua a, a om ngawl nate na sim thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima le keima, “Mihing thupi khat ka suak zo a, ka mai ah Jerusalem a ukte sangin ka ciim zaw pek hi. Ciimna le heakna tatak tel ing,” ka kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Heakna le mawmawtna, ciimna le thin apnate a kilamdanna kan tu in ka khensat hi. Ahihang vuiva del taw ka kiban tu sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ciim vaial leang thinngimna tam vaial a, heak vaial na in hong ngimsak vaial zawkan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungdamna zongin nuam ka sak babangin om tong ci in ka khensat hi. Ahizong, hisia zongh luithawthong hi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nuina in mawmawthuai a, nopsakna in bangma phattuamna hong pia ngawl ci sia ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ciimna ka thangaina in kei hong tawsawn a, keima le keima thinnop ka kipiak natu in sapittui ne in hunnuam zak tu ka khensat hi. Hi leitung ah tawmvei a nuntak hunsung mihingte ngamtat zia tu sia hisia a phabel hi vak ci in ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lianpite ka seam zo hi. Keima atu in innte ka sa a, sapithuante ka vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan vawtin thingno ka ciing a, a sungah thingnga kung namcin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate tuibuak natu in tuikhukte ka to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sila tam mama ka lei a, ka inn sungsuak sila tam mama om hi. Jerusalem khua ah a teang ngeite theampo sangin nganno tamzaw ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ukna ngam kumpi sumkholnate panin ngunn le khamhte ka la hi. Pasal le nupite in lasa in hong ngualnuamsak a, pasal khat ii dik a sak numeite ka dei zaza ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi hi, kei ka lian a, Jerusalem khua ah a teang ngei khat po sangin ka lian zaw a, ka ciimna bo ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka dei pawpo ka nga hi. Nopsakna a min piang, bangma ka kidan bua hi. Ka sep sa theampo tungah ka kisuangtaak a, hite theampo sia ka min phatna tel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaciang ka sep sa theampo le haksa tak ka sepnate ka ngaisun a, bangma khiakna a nei ngawl hunlam ka phawk hi. Tuasia in vuiva del taw kibang a, kimanna om vet ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangbang po ahizong kumpi khat in ama mai a, a seam kumpite ii sep sa teng seam thei bek hi. Tua ahikom ciimna, ahibuale maitatna, ahibuale mawmawtnate bang ziam cisia ngaisut ka kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Oh, he ing, “Khuavak sia khuazing sangin a phat zawk bangma, ciimna sia mawmawtna sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing ciimte in a pai natu mun mu thei a, a mawmawte in mu thei ngawl hi,”. Ahihang eite theampo atu in mai sangah a kibangin ih thuak tu thu in hong ngak nginge ci sia zongh ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in hi bang, “Mihing mawmawte tungah a tung thu sia kei tung zongh ah hong tung tu hi. Tua ahikom ka ciim mama na in bang meetna hong pia ziam?” ci in ka ngaisun hi. Bangma hong pia ngawl hi, na khat beak zongh hong pia ngawl hi,” ci in ka zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kuama in mihing ciimte phawk ngawl a, kuama in a mawmawte phawk ngawl hi. Hong pai tu hunte sungah ih vekpi in hong kimangil siat tu hi. A ciim le a mawmaw a kibangin ih thi siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom nuntakna in kei atu bangma khiakna nei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile nuntakna in ngimna simngawl bangma hong puak ngawl hi. Na theampo a luithawthong hi a, vuiva del bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naseam a, ka thalawte khiakna nei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile ka za hong laih tu sia atu in a nusiat tu ka hi hunlam ka he hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaciang tua pa a ciim ahile, a mawmaw ahi akua in he ziam? Ahizong ka sep ka vawt theampo, ka ciimna ii hi leitung ah kei atu a thalaw theampo ama in lua tu hi. A vekpi a luithawthong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ahikom nasia tak na ka sep sia ka kisiik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na khat pawpo atu in na ciimna, na heakna le na thiamna theampo taw naseam a, a zawkciang tua na sia a seam ngawl het khat tungah na nusiat lel tu hi. A luithawthong hi a, maan zongh maan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na nuntak sungah thinngim tak ngimin na na sep hangin bang na lak tu om na ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na nuntak laiteng na sep na vawt theampo in thinngimna le thin natna simngawl bangma dang hong puak ngawl hi. Zan ngawngawn in na mutmawklaw hi. A vekpi a luithawthong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mihing khat ii a phabel a sep thei sia neak tu dawn tu le a thalaw sa teng taw a lungkim tu ahi hi. Ahizong, hisia ngawngawn Pathian kung pan hong pai hi, cisia ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ngawlin bangbangin neak tu le lungkim natu koisung pan nga thei tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian a lungdamsak te tungah Pathian in ciimna, heakna, le lungdamna pia hi, ahihang mimawte ii thalaw sate ama a lungkimsakte tungah a piak thei tu in ama in mawneite na seamsak, sum thalawsakin sum kholsak hi. A vekpi a luithawthong ahi hi. Tuasia in vuiva delkot bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a piang na theampo Pathian see sa bangin piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in pian natu le thi natu hun, suan tu hun le bawkeak tu hun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thalup tu hun le damsak tu hun, phelthap tu hun le sakto tu hun ciangtan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in hee natu hun le lungdam natu hun, mau tu hun le lap tu hun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ki it tu hun le ki etsat tu hun, kinap tu hun le kinap ngawl tu hun, ciangtan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in zon tu hun le bosua tu hun, top tu hun le vawk tu hun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />balthap tu hun le khuikhop tu hun thim dide in om tu hun le pau tu hun ciangtan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in it tu hun le etsat tu hun, ngal kisim tu hun le kilem tu hun ciangtan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ih sep ih vawtte theampo pan bang meetna nga hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in vanh ngitpi eite hong sot ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in na theampo atu hun a lem tu in ciangtan hi. Ama in maisang hong pai tu thute heak nopna thin hong pia ahihang ama ii sep le vawtte a cingin hong telsak ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom ih nuntak laiteng ih lungdam tu le ih sep thei bang a phabel ih sep tu ahi hunlam ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ih sep thaman taw ne in dawnin, ih nopsak tu ahi hi. Tuasia in Pathian ii letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian ii sep theampo sia a tawntung atu ahi hunlam ka he hi. Bangma belap heak in a, bangma dawk kik heak in. Pathian ii na a sep khat sia ama ih zatak natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A piang na khat ahibuale a piang tu na khat sia a piang ngeisa ahi hi. Pathian in na khat sia a kibangin piangsak kikik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bek dom ngawlin hi leitung ah thutang le thumaan om tu kilawm napi ngitlo khansiatnate na mu sia kei zongh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima le keima, “Pathian in mihing phate le mihing siate a kibangin thu khen tu hi, banghang ziam cile na a kiseam theampo sia a hun a kiciangtan bangin piang tu hi,” ka kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eite nganhingte sangin ih phat zawk tuan ngawlna hong lak tu in Pathian in eite hong ze et ci in ka khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A tawpna ah, mihing le nganhing ii a thuak tute in a kibangin ngak hi. Nganhing bangma in mihing zongh thi hi. Amate in bitphua nam hi khawm hi. Mihing khat sia nganhing khat sangin phazaw tuan ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate atu in nuntakna in khiakna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate mun khat zuan khawm tu a, leivui suak tu uh hi. Amate leivui pan hong paikhawm uh a, leivui ah ciakhawm kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Banghangin khat po in mihingte ii thaa sia tungsang zuanto a, nganhingte ii thaa ahile leinuai zuansuk hi, ci in tel thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom ih sep thei a phabel sia ih sepsa tungah ih lungkim thei tu ahi sia ka phawk hi. Ih vawt thei dang bangma om ngawl hi. Ih thi zawkciang bang suak tu cisia ih heak thei natu lampi om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaciang hi leitung ah a piang thumaan ngawlna theampo ka en kik hi. A kivawtsiate kakap a, kuama in hu ngawl hi. Kuama in amate hu ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate a vawtsiate in thahatna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thi le a bo sate ka eang hi, a nungta laite sangin amate nuamsa zaw pek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang tuate sangin a hamphazaw laite sia hi leitung ah a piang thumaan ngawl a mu ngeingawl, a piang ngawl laite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihingte in ngual a zaw natu in banghangin nasia tak na seam ziam ci zongh ka tel zo hi, banghang ziam cile a innpaamte a een hang ahi hi. Ahihang tuasia in a luithawthong ahi hi. Tuasia in vuiva del taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing khat pukthi liang dongin leekoai in a omcipna sia mawmawt vai hi, amate in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zongh hi thei tha tu hi, ahihang vuiva man nuam a, khut nii taw komlaak tawntung sangin thinnopna taw, tawmno ih nei sia phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nuntakna sungah luithawthong ahi, thudang khat zongh ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi sungah ama nguakin a teang khat om hi. Ama in tapa le nei ngawl, suapui le nei ngawl hikale ama sia na seam tawntung a, bangma hunin a hauna taw lungkim ngeingawl hi. Ama le ama nopsaknate nialin, akua atu in nasia takin na seam ziam? Tuasia zongh luithawthong hi a, tuaciang a ngim huai mama nuntakzia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khat sangin nii phazaw hi, banghang ziam cile amate ngeal in a kizen zaw in naseam khawm thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate khat a puk le a dang khat in phongto thei hi. Ahihang khat nguak a om khat sia puk le mansa hi lel hi, banghang ziam cile kuama a hu tu om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khua a sik le nii lumkhawm leang khualum thei hi, ahihang nang nguak bangbangin na khua lumsak thei tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khat nguak ii lel tu kisimna sia nii in zo thei hi. Khauzam thum taw a kipheak khauzeen sia a tat tu haksa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing khat sia zawnna panin a ngam ii kumpi suak tu in khangto thei a, ahibuale thonginn pan kumpi tokhum dong kaato thei hi, ahizong a khan haam ciang ngual ii ngaisut pha piakte saan ngawl tu dongin a mawmaw le, tua pa sangin khangmoi a zawng a pil khat phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a teang mihing theampo ka ngaisun a, amate sungah kumpipa ii dinmun a la tu khangmoi khat a om sia ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa khat ii a uk mihingte sia kisim zo ngawl tha tu a, ama a thi zawkciang ama nasep sate hangin a lungdam khat beak om ngawl tu hi. Tuasia in luithawthong ahi hi. Tuasia in vuiva del bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Biakinnpi ah na pai ciang kidawm in. Tua munah pai in thusin tu sia, a maan le a maan ngawl a he ngawl mihing mawmawte ii sangaw biakpiakna sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na pau ma in ngaisun phot in a, Pathian tungah kamciam vawt memeang heak in. Ama sia vantung ah om in, nang sia leitung ah om a, tua ahikom na pau tu za sangin a tamzaw pau heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thinngimna a tam zaza in na mang sia vaial tu hi. Kam tam na pau zaza in mawmawt kamte na pau tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian tungah kamciam na piak ciang, manlang takin taangtungsak in. Ama in mihing mawmawte diksa ngawl hi. Na kamciam bangin vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamciam pia a, nasep ngawl sangin kamciam piak awl lete phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khial tha ing ci in Pathian thiampipa mai ah na son kul tu ahikom, na kampauna in khialna sung thensak heak in. Banghang na tungah Pathian thin uuksak ni ziam? Nasep sa theampo ama in banghang laltham siatsak ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangza in mang na man a, bangza in a luithawthong nasep naseam zong, ahibuale bangza in na pau hial zong, Pathian na zatak veve kul lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpite in mizawngte vawtsia in amate hamphat natu te danh in thumaan ngawlin thu a khen na mu ciang lamdang sa heak in. Ulian khat pawpo, a tungsia a ulian sia in vuumsit a, amate ngeal sia a tung sawn a sia in vuumsit lalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpi khat ngawngawn in thaw an suang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sum na it le na lungkim ngeingawl tu a, hau tu na lungngul le na dei theampo na nga ngei buatu hi. Tuasia in a luithawthong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na hau vaial le na vaak tu tam vaial tu hi. Na meet belna sia na hau hunlam na heak sia bekma hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Naseam khat sia a neak khom tu zongh nei thei a, nei ngawl thei si hi, ahizong ama sia zanin a mut nuam lel hi. Sumhaupa sia, nei leilam ahikom thinngim a, zanin mutthip thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a lauhuai ka mu thu khat om hi: mihingte in a kitaangsap uh ciang a zak tu in a sum tawm uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaciang nasep pha ngawl khat tungah sumhcip in a tate atu zongh bangma kheet ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi leitung ah pumnguak in ih sua bangma, pumnguak in ih nusia hi. Bangza po ih seam zong ih ken thei bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi thu maan ngawl hi! Ih pai lai bang lianin ih cia kik hi. Na ih seam a, vui man tu in ih hanciam hi, ahihang bang nga na hi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eite sia khua zing sungah heena, thinngimna, thin uukna le ciinat thuakin ih nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi sungah ka phaw thu om hi: Pathian ii hong piak nuntak tomno sungin ih sep thaman ne in dawnin, nuamsa in ih om tu sia a phabel ahi hi. Hisia in mihing ii thuak tu nuntakzia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian in mihing khat hauna le neisa lamhsa pia in tuate tungah a lung a damsak le ama sia lungkim in a sep a vawt tungah nuamsa tu hi. Hisia in Pathian letsong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian in ama lungdamsak ahikom, a nuntakna a tom hunlam thinngim leilam ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a nasia mama a maan ngawl het a kivawt khat om ci sia ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in mihing khat sia hauna, min phatna le neisa pia hi, hi hi, a dei theampo pia hi, ahihang tua vanhte tungah nopsakna pia ngawl hi. Khualmi khat po in nopsak law tu hi. Tuasia in a luithawthong ahi hi, maan ngawl het hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing khat in ta zakhat nei in, a khansau kale, bang tanvei po a nungta zong, ama ii tel tu lungdam na a nga bua a, a thi ciang pha tak a kiphum buale, nausen a thisa in a suak sia phazaw lai hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua nausen a sua hu in phattuamna om ngawl hi; ama sia khuazing sungah bo in kimangil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nausen in sun khuavak sia mu ngeingawl a, nuntak zongh bangbang hi ci in he ngawl hi, ahihang ama in a no belin tawlngakna a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in kum tulnii nungta kale, a nuntak sung thinnopna a nei ngei buale a thisa a suak tua nausen sia phazaw hi. A tatak ci leang amate ngeal in a zot natu mun kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing khat in bang khat po a neak thei natu in naseam ahihang a kicing in nei ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangbangin mihing ciim khat sia a mawmaw khat sangin nuamsa zaw ziam? Mizawng khat in nuntak natu zia a heak hangin bang phatuam ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia in a luithawthong hi. Tuasia in vuiva delkot bang ahi hi. Na neisa taw na lungkim tu sia, nadang dei tawntung sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na a piang theampo sia taanghtawng lai pan a piang tu in a kiseesa hi a, mihing khat in ama sangin a hat zaw mihing khat ii kam nial thei ngawl ci sia ih he siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na nial vaial le a luithawthong hi vaial a, nang sia phazaw tuan ngawl ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Limh khat bangin a papai nuntakna sia a luithawthong ama nuntakna hi a, a tom a nuntak sungah mihing atu a phabel sia akua in he thei tu ziam? Bangbangin mihing khat in a thi zawkciang leitung ah bang thu piang tu cisia he thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Min phatna sia a manham paaknamtui sangin phazaw a, na thi ni sia na sua ni sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuangaina inn ah pai sia poai vawtna inn ah pai sangin phazaw hi, banghang ziam cile a nungta lai eite theampo thina in hong ngak nginge hi cisia hong phawksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Heena in nuina sang phazaw a; na mai hong khingsak tha tu ahitazong, na heakna khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungdamna thu a ngaisun tawntung mihing sia mihing mawmaw ahi hi. Mihing ciim khat in thina thu ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte ii pokna la hong sak sangin mihing ciimte ii hong teih sia phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing mawmaw khat a nui ciang, mei sungah lingkung hal puak vazak bang ahi hi. Bangma khiakna nei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ciim khat in mihing khat pawpo a theam ciang a mawmaw khat bangin ngamta na suak hi. Sumnguk na ne le na ngamtatzia lalsak, na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khat pawpo ii a tawpna sia a kipatna sangin phazaw hi. Thin sauna sia kiphatsakna sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thin tomna uk in; diksak ngawlna nei top tu sia mawmawthuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Oh! banghangin nidang in na theampo phazaw ziam?” ci in dongh peuma heak in. Tua in pil thudok hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing nungta peuma sia a ciim tu kilawm a, tua in ngamhlua bangza in pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sum in hong thin nopsak za in ciimna zongh in hong thinnuamsak hi. Ciimna in hong keamcing a, hisia in heakna ii phattuamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian ii sep sate ngaisun in. Pathian ii a koaisak sate akua in bangbangin maamsak thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang atu in nate a dik a pha in a pian ciang lungdam in a, ngimna hong pai ciang phawk lel in: Pathian in lungdamna le ngimna pia khawm a; a zawkciang bang piang tu ci, na he ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nuntakna sia a luithawthong hi a, ahizong ka nuntak sungin thu theampo ka mu zo hi. Mihing khat sia pha napi thi a, a dang khat sia, sia napi nungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom pha lei heak in a, ciim lei heak in — banghangin nangma le nangma kithatlum tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong ngilo lei heak in a, mawmaw lei heak in — banghangin na hun a tun ma in thi tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua a leilam te ngeal pial in. Pathian na thasia le na ma vang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuapi uk mihing sawmte ii khuapi khat atu a vawt thei sangin ciimna in mihing khat atu tam vawt zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Leitung ah a maan bek seam tawntung in, khialna khat a vawt ngeingawl kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingte ii thuson theampo ngai heak in — na naseampa ii hong sonsiatna za tha tu ni hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma zongh in midangte tamvei mama na sonsiat sia kihe nginge ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hite theampo ahile ahi ngawl khentel tu in ka ciimna ka zangh hi. A ciim tu ma in khensatna ka nei hi, ahizong kei ii hi zawk hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nuntakna ii a khiakna akua in mu thei tu ziam? Tuasia eite atu in thuk lei a, heak tu in haksa lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahihang keima in pilna, thiamna heak natu in ka ki aap a, pilna mu in, thupiangte ahang ka heak natu, pil ngawlna sia bangza in ngitlo huai a mawmawthuai ziam ci thu ka heak natu in nasia takin ka hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thina sangin a khaa zaw khat ka mu hi — tua in thaang taw a kibang numei ahi hi. Ama ii hong itna in ngeen bangin nang hong man tu a, ama hong koaina in thikkhau khat bangin nang hong heencip tu hi. Pathian ii deina bangin a ngamta sia in tuabang numei pial thei a, ahizong a khial sia, a thaang sungah awk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi hi, hi thute ii a khiakna ka zawzon ciang tawtawm in ka mu hi. Thuthuk ngaisunpa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A khiakna dang ka zon hangin ka mu bua hi. Tulkhat sung pan ka zatak tu pasal khat ka mu thei a, ahizong numei khat zongh ka mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hisia in ka sin theampo ahi hi: Pathian in eite a thumaan tu in hong vawt hi napi paulap tuatuam zongin eima le eima ih kikai awksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nate ii khiakna tatak sia mihing ciim khat bek in he hi. Ciimna in ama maitaisak a, a mai siatna teng bosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa ii ci bangin vawt in a, Pathian tungah kamciam pia memeang heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in a uk po vawt thei a, tua ahikom ama omna pial in; tuabang a lauhuai munah om heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in a thuneina taw ngamta a, ama ii sepna sia kuama in thato thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thupiakte na nit lai tengin ngimna na thuak buatu a, tuaciang mihing ciim khat in koibang le bang hun ciang vawt tu ci sia he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na theampo vawt natu a hun maan le sepzia maan om a, ahihang ih heak thu tawm lei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang hong piang tu cisia kuama in ih he bua a, ei hong son tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kuama in thina pial thei ngawl a, a thi tu ni khangkhan thei ngawl hi. Tua in ih pial thei ngawl ngal kisimna khat hi a, ih ngelku thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a kivawt sate ka ngaisut ciang hite theampo ka mu a, hi leitung ah mihing pawlkhat in thahatna nei a, pawlkhat te in tuate khutnuai ah thuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi hi mi seksolte amate thaankuul sungah kiphum ka mu a, ahihang a phuum mihingte thaan pan a cia kik uh ciang, amate ii a sia a vawtna, khuapi sung mama ah a khua mite in amate pok uh hi. Tuasia in a luithawthong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghangin mihingte in ol vazeang in khutkhial ziam? Banghang ziam cile khut khialna sia man lalang in daan a kipiak ngawl hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khial khat in khut khialna zakhatvei vawt a, ahizong nungta veve hi. Oh, hi hi, amate kampau nate ka he a, “Pathian thu na ni uh le na theampo a pha in piang tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahizong mihing ngilote atu in phatna om ngawl tu hi. Amate ii nuntak hun sia limh khat taw kibang a, Pathian thu ni ngawl ahikom amate khanthi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang hite nawnsan thu ahi hi. Leitung ah bang thu piang ziam ci sia en vun; khat vevei mihing thutangte in misiate ii thuak tu daante thuak a, misiate in thutangte min phatna tel nga hi. Hisia in a luithawthong hi, ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom mihing khat in a nuntak sungin nuam a sak tu ngawl a dang om ngawl ahikom anne tuidawn in, a lungkim tu bek a hina ka he hi. Pathian in hi leitung ah nuntakna a piak hun sung teng, ama in a sep thaman nga thei tu hi bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ciim tu hanciam in hi leitung ah bang piang cisia ka tel ciangin sun zong zan zong mu ngawlin na om thei sia ka phawk hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaciang Pathian in bang seam cisia ka tel zo bua hi. Bangza po na hanciambel hang na tel zo ngei buatu hi. Mihing ciimte in he kisa tha tu hi, ahihang amate he ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thute theampo khuangeipi le nasia takin ka ngaisun a, Pathian in mihing ciimte le mihing thutangte ngamtatna te, amate ki itna le kihuatna ngawngawn uk hi cisia ka phawk hi. A mai ah bang om ziam ci sia kuama in he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kilamdanna om tuan ngawl hi. Thutangte le a ngilo te, a phate le a siate, biakna hanciamte le a awlmaw ngawlte, sangaw biakpiakna a vawtte le a vawt ngawlte tungah a kibangin thina theng hi. Mihing pha khat sia mihing khial khat taw kitumdang ngawl a, tom lo in a kiciam khat le a kiciam ngawl khat kitumdang tuan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thina sia mihing theampo tungah a kibangin tung a, hi thu mama zongh, leitung ah a piang na dangte bangma in maan ngawl hi. Mihingte a nuntak laiteng a thinsung uh sia siatna le mawmawtna taw kidim a, amate thakhat thu in thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong leitung ah a nungta khat pawpo in lametna pawlkhat nei a, ui nungta khat sia tawpi thisa khat sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi hi, a nungtate in a thi tu uh he a, ahizong a thite in bangma he ngawl hi. Amate in min phatna tel bangma nei tuan ngawl a, amate kimangil cip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ki itna, a kihuatna, cii le sa uukna te a vekpi in amate taw thi khawm hi. Hi leitung ah a piang nate khat pawpo sungah amate kihel kik nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pai in, na an ne in a, lungdam in; na sapittui ne in a, maitai in. Pathian in diksa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tawntung lungdam in, maitai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian hong piak hi leitung ah a mannung ngawl na nuntak hunsung teng na it numei taw a nuamin nungta in. A mannung ngawl nite a nuamin zangh in, banghang ziam cile, tuasia bekma na ngim thaman na saan tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sep pawpo hanciam in seam in, banghang ziam cile mithite ngamah, tukna, dianna om ngawl, khua ngaisutna, heakna, ciimna om ngawl tu hi — tua mun sia na zotna tu mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thudang khat zongh ka he lai hi, hi leitung ah tai ngang theampo in zawna nga tawntung ngawl a, ngalhang theampo in ngalzo tawntung ngawl hi. Mihing ciimte in nuntak natu thalaw tawntung zo ngawl a, mihing pilte zongh hau tawntung ngawl hi, hi theina a nei theampo dinmun sang theng tuan ngawl hi. Kaamsiatna sia mihing theampo tungah tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hun hong thet tu na he ngei bua hi. Thakhat thu in vacimte thaang sungah a kimat bang, ngasate ngeen taw a kimat bangin, eite zongh ih muanmawk ngawl het laitakin thaang sungah hong kiman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nadang khat ma ka mu a, ciimna sia hi leitung ah a thupi in a kingaisut zia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khua khat om a tua ii sungah mihing tam teang ngawl hi. A thahat kumpipa khat in tua khua sim hi. Ama in uumci a, a luphungte sutham tu in kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua khua ah mizawng ahihang khua khat a hu zo tu mihing pil mama khat teang hi. Ahizong kuama in ama phawk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ciimna sia hatna sangin phazaw hi ka ci tawntung hi, ahizong kuama in mizawngpa sia mihing ciim in ngaisun ngawl a, ama paunate kuama in nadon ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kamneam mihing ciim khat ii pauna sia mihing mawmaw honkhat kikhopna sungah a lampuipa auna ngai tu sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ciimna in ngalhiamte sangin a pha seam thei zaw a, ahizong mihing khial khat in na pha tam mama lalsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho thisate in paaknamtui bung bup khat uihsak thei a, mawmawtna tawmno khat in ciimna lianbel siasak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing ciim khat in a maan khat a sep tu le, a mawmaw khat in a maan ngawl a sep tu sia a ngeina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama mawmawtna sia lampi ah a kisikpui khualmite ngawngawn in tel pai a; ama mihing mawmaw ahi hunlam mihing theampo in hesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang hong ukpa na tungah a thin a uuk le nasep tawp tu ngen heak in; thim dide in na om le khialna liante zongh hong kimaisak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi leitung ah a dik ngawl thu khat ka mu a — ngamukte ii a kilawm ngawl ngamtatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte thuneina dinmun kipia a, mihaute kimel sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Silate siphu tungah to a, kumpinamte silate bangin peang taw vak ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dum na to le a sungah na taak tu a; luphung khat na sulet le ngul khat in nang hong tu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suangkhuk ah na na seam le suang taw na liam tu hi. Thing na ek le tua nasepna taw na liam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hei a mawl a, na taat buale na zak ciang na nasep haksa zaw tu hi, maisang atu zeak khol sia pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngul zol thiam napi na tusak masa le ngul zol na thiam sia a phat tuamna om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing ciim khat ii kampauna in ama min phasak a, ahizong mihing mawmaw khat sia ama kammal ma in siasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a mawmawthuai kampau a, mawmawt kam taw khup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mawmaw khat sia papau in lului hi. Kuama in maisang thupiang tu he ngawl a, ih thi zawkciang bang suak tu cisia kuama in hong son thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Inn lam a zong kik thei ngawl, a mawmaw leilam khat sia a nasepna taw zawm law tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngam uk kumpipa khangmoi lai in, ngam lampuite in zan tha pai in poai a khaam uh le, tua ngam sia ngim nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahizong kumpipa in ama thu in thu a khensat thei a lampuite in a hun maanin an ne in, amate le amate zu khamcip ngawl natu, a ki uk zo le tua ngam sia a hampha ngam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pasal khat a datham lei in a innkhum a pua buale a inn kuai tu a, a inn cimh tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Poai khaamna in nang hong lungdamsakin, sapittui in hong maitaisak hi, ahizong khat zongh sum ngawl taw na nga thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thimtham in kumpipa son sia heak in a, sumhaupa sia na aituam lupna inndoi sung zongh ah sonsia heak in. Vacim khat po in na pau teng amate thu puakin son tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na sumte ngamdang taw sum vawtna ah zangh in, tua hile ni khat ni ciang a meet nga tu ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na sumte mun tuatuam ah koi in a — mun tam mama ah sum vawt in — banghang ziam cile hi leitung ah bang kaamsiatna thuak tu ci sia na he bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thingkung khat sia, koisang po ah a puk zong poimaw ngawl hi, a puna munah om tu hi. Meeite a niim ciang nguazu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vuite le khuahunte a phat dong ngakin na om le bangma hunin an na ciing ngei buatu a, bangma hunin an na la ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in na theampo vawt a, ama sep le vawtte numei naupaai khat ii sulh sungah nuntakna thak khat a kipat, na tel zawk ngawl bangin na tel zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zing ahizong nitak ahizong an ciing in. A pha in po tu maw, ahibuale anciin hun khat sia hun khat sang phazaw tu maw, ci sia na he ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sun khuavak nuam na sak thei sia thupha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na nuntak kumte hu in lungdam in. Bang tanvei na nungta zong na thi tu khuangei zaw ahi sia phawk in. Mai sangah lamet tu bangma om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khangnote awng, na khangmoi hun nuamsa vun. Na khanmoi lai in lungdam vun. Na vawt nop po vawt vun a, na lungngulna bangin ngamta vun. Ahihang Pathian in na vawtna tungah thu hong khen tu cisia ciamtee tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangma in thinngimsak heak vun a, bangma in nasak heak vun, khangmoi hun khuangeingawl tu nu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na thinngim tu ni le a kum hong thet ma, “Nuntak paw nuamsa bong” na ci ma, na khangmoi lai in nang hong Bitphuapa phawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hun sia, ni le tha le aksite ii tanna nang atu in a dial hun le ngua meei a ven nawn ngawl hun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuasia ciang nang hong dal na baante liing tu a, tu laitak a, a hat na peangte tha zawm tu hi. Na hate na an thai tu in tawm lei tu a, na mitte mangin khua pha tak na mu thei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na bil in khuaza ngawl tu a, lampi ah awngingte na za buatu hi. An ngoaina sette a kingoai ciang ahizong, tumtheite a kitum ciang ahizong, nakheng phaksap vamial in na za tu a, ahizong vacim khat po haam in na mut hong phawng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mun saangna ah na kiinta tu a, na lampai ciang lauhuai tu hi. Na puakkaang tu a; nangma le nangma kikai vakiat in, na lungngul theampo bo tu hi. Eite in a khakbel ih tawlngak natu mun ih zuan tu a, lampite ah mauna om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngunnkhau tat tu a, khamh meiinn taaksuk in tamhtham tu hi; tuikhuk ah khauzeen sia tatin tuibeal zaantham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ih pumpite leivui ah cia kik tu a, ih thaa ahile nuntakna hong pia pa Pathian kung zuan kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Luithawthong, luithawthong, Thuthuk Ngaisunpa in ci hi. A vekpi a luithawthong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuthuk Ngaisunpa sia ciim ahikom ama in a heak thute mihingte tungah hil hi. Ama in paunakte encian a, tuate a maanna sittel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuthuk Ngaisunpa in a henepna kammalte zong a, ahihang ama ii a at kammalte a maan tatak veu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing ciimte ii paunakte sia tuucingte ii tuute a cinna tu a, a zak ciangzumte bang hi a, a khoptua paunakte sia kho takin a kikhen thikpimte bang ahi hi. Tuate sia eite theampo hong cing ih tuucingpa Pathian ii hong piak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tapa awng, kidop tu thudang khat om lai hi. Laibute a ki at sia tawp hun ci om thei ngawl a, lai tam lei simna in pumpi thazawmsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hite theampo zawkciang son tu thu khat bek om lai hi: Pathian thasia in a, a thupiakte ni in, banghang ziam cile hite theampo sia mihing a kibitphuana thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in ih sep ih vawtte theampo, a pha ahizong, a sia ahizong, ih vawt kute ngawngawn dongin thu hong khen tu hi.
  </para>
</usx>
